    "interpretation_A": "DiskANN recall is NOT an in-degree function: the cliff to 0 happens at sink_frac=0.003 where max in-degree is only 414 -- inside HNSW's SAFE regime (<200). For Vamana the controlling variable is the single-medoid ENTRY POINT, not in-degree. The in-degree blow-up still occurs (shared family marker) but does not mediate the collapse here.",
